     "author": {
      "accountId": "5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Address immediately</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>deprecate MOVE and COPY</li>\n\t<li>support for creation of external content</li>\n\t<li>helper for Want-Digest on GET/HEAD</li>\n\t<li>helper for Accept-Datetime on GET/HEAD (Should this be scoped to a GetMementoBuilder subtype?)</li>\n\t<li>POST/PUT helper for setting interaction model, constants for types from spec</li>\n\t<li>POST/PUT add optional \"acl\" relational</li>\n\t<li>PATCH should optionally allow for setting Content-Type</li>\n\t<li>Add PostMementoBuilder, which extends PostBuilder and adds helper for memento-datetime header</li>\n\t<li>Update dependencies</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Suggested</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Provide helpers/constants for specification defined GET Prefer headers</li>\n\t<li>Add helpers for State Token headers</li>\n\t<li>helper for Cache-Control: no-cache, as it is recommended in the spec for Want-Digest</li>\n\t<li>General method for adding Link header to POST/PUT/PATCH</li>\n\t<li>Some work to improve support for WebAC. Currently the client only does basic auth, could add support for an auth header.</li>\n\t<li>Flag for whether to follow redirects, in the case of redirect ext content</li>\n\t<li>GetTimemapBuilder, which defaults to \"Accept: application/link-format\"</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Possible extras</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>More response method helpers, such as getting the ACL Location,<br/>\n   * Or constants for response headers, like Accept-External-Content-Handling<br/>\n   * Helper method for getting types, and/or hasInteractionModel</li>\n\t<li>Constants for versioning concepts<br/>\n  * <a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeGate</a><br/>\n  * <a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeMap\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#TimeMap</a><br/>\n  * <a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource</a><br/>\n  * <a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#Memento\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#Memento</a></li>\n\t<li>Link rels, original timegate timemap (acl)</li>\n\t<li>Constants for link header rels<br/>\n   * <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy</a><br/>\n   * <a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent</a><br/>\n   * acl<br/>\n   * original<br/>\n   * timegate<br/>\n   * timemap</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Fcrepo community impl extension module</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Add support for transactions (we have done so locally at unc, but its ugly and we can probably wait for sidecar spec)</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "13/Nov/18 7:41 PM",
